# Claude 3xb archive

> A Claude conversation archive on the 3XB entity-intelligence thread.

## Purpose
Explain this repo as saved talk about 3XB, not as the live API. Source: fitzyracing1/claude-3xb.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the chat history in this repo.
2. Use it to recall 3XB talk.
3. Use earthenwarecomputer.com or related repos for the running system.

## Key ideas
- Conversation archive
- 3XB thread
- Family of claude-* repos

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/claude-3xb
archive = conversation_shelf("3xb")
read(archive)
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. conversation_shelf("3xb") → “this folder holds that thread”
2. read(archive) → “open the saved talk”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the live API → send them to earthenwarecomputer / 3xb repos
- If a reader wants the chat → stay here

## What a person would notice
Talk about entity intelligence, not the running search.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the archive, or the 3XB demo.
